{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@2824","endTime":334667.95,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 15\nNetwork Capital.\n\nA mortgage website presenting home-loan and refinance pathways with a clear application entry point.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nMortgage & finance\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nA direct route to the next home decision.\n\nClarigo’s published overview identifies Network Capital as a website for mortgages, refinancing, and home loans. The supplied artwork gives these visitor goals prominent positions in the hero and navigation. This case study focuses on the visible website structure without repeating unverified rate, fee, or processing-time claims.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Network Capital's original project material.\n\n01\nMortgage pathway\n\nThe website presentation includes an entry point for mortgage applications.\n\n02\nRefinance pathway\n\nRefinancing is presented as a separate visitor goal.\n\n03\nLoan information\n\nNavigation provides access to home-loan content.\n\n04\nAccount access\n\nAn account entry appears alongside the application action.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nMortgage & finance\n\nOrange calls to action sit within a clean white navigation system. Lifestyle photography gives the landing page context, while short introductory messages keep the application and refinance pathways visible.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Network Capital.\n\nExplore the original design compositions. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nNetwork Capital's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nNetwork Capital / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nWhizara\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nCOURSES & LEARNING\nWhizara\nLEARNING OPERATIONS\nEs-Platform\nSERVICES MARKETPLACE\nBeen There\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
